- **Features**: 10 columns (UDI, Product ID, Type, 5 sensor readings, Target, Failure Type)

**Data Collection Notes**:
- Machine Types: L (Low), M (Medium), H (High) power requirements
- Temperature: Measured in Kelvin (K)
- Torque: Measured in Newton-meters (Nm)
- Tool Wear: Measured in minutes of operation
- Target: Binary (0 = No Failure, 1 = Failure)

